// "Bars any living creature from crossing its edge" -- no physical
// entity-blocking/collision-barrier primitive exists (checked; the only
// "barrier" content in this compendium is flavor text over a damage-
// reduction buff, e.g. globe_of_invulnerability.ron next door). Modeled
// as a defensive `ProtectingWard`, same self-only shape as backlash.ron,
// with the entry-barring rider dropped as an honest gap rather than
// silently claimed.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: ProtectingWard, data: BuffData(strength: 0.35, duration: Some(60.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 90.0,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Abjuration),
        source: Some(Primordial),
        // level 5 spell -> min_level 30, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(30)),
    ),
)
